\f0\fs32 \cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 Two supporting disciplines: quarantine paths never enter the wire contract or the database (so no authority can dangle into quarantine), and GC only collects unreferenced objects older than a horizon longer than the publish\uc0\u8594 commit gap, so it can never race an in-flight publication.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

