\f1 \cf2 \cb3 Stop/go gates must be numeric
\f0 , set from the fixtures themselves: e.g., zero orphan-authority violations across N\uc0\u8805 500 randomized fault injections; zero clobbered saves across M concurrent-save trials; p95 admission\u8594 visible under a stated bound excluding cold model load; save p95 under a stated bound at fixture document size. The specific numbers matter less than refusing to ship Phase B on a happy-path demo. Use real-sized fixtures (hundreds of assets, real image dimensions) from day one \'97 "works on toy data" is the classic false negative.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
