\f2\b\fs40 \cf2 \strokec2 5. Deterministic model acquisition for a fresh machine\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs32 \cf2 Model it as a\'a0
\f1 transactional per-artifact state machine
\f0 \'a0with a journaled transition log, so interruption anywhere resumes correctly:\
\pard\pardeftab720\qc\partightenfactor0

\f1\fs28 \cf2 \cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f6 \cf2 \cb3 not_installed \uc0\u8594  downloading(resumable) \u8594  verifying \u8594  installing(stage+rename)\
