\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Repair:
\f0 \'a0boot probe detects size/hash/path mismatch \uc0\u8594 \'a0
\f6\fs28 \cb5 broken
\f0\fs32 \cb3 ; repair re-verifies or re-fetches; never silently proceed.\cb1 \
\ls5\ilvl0
\f1 \cb3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Advertising rule:
\f0 \'a0a capability is advertised iff every artifact it needs is\'a0
