\f6\fs28 \cb5 missing_prerequisites
\f0\fs32 \cb3 \'a0+\'a0
\f6\fs28 \cb5 setup_hint
\f0\fs32 \cb3 .\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb3 UX is one doctor screen: artifacts with state, size, license, disk impact, retry. Edge cases handled explicitly: disk-full mid-install (clean abort,\'a0
\f6\fs28 \cb5 .part
\f0\fs32 \cb3 \'a0preserved), concurrent installs (one setup queue through the same writer discipline), revoked artifacts (hide capability with guidance). Installation quality is the first-run bottleneck in a local product; treat it with the same rigor as the completion transaction.\
