\f2\b\fs40 \cf2 \strokec2 6. Making Wan2GP upgrades boring\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs32 \cf2 An upgrade PR should touch\'a0
\f1 only the submodule SHA, the build manifest, and rarely the patch file
\f0 \'a0\'97 anything else is a review red flag. The gate suite:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls6\ilvl0
\f1 \cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	1	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Static:
\f0 \'a0import/path contract tests for the\'a0
\f6\fs28 \cb5 wgp_bridge.py
\f0\fs32 \cb3 \'a0cwd/sys.path assumptions; patch-applicability checks that every monkeypatch target still exists with a compatible signature (reflection tests);\'a0
\f6\fs28 \cb5 wgp_config.json
\f0\fs32 \cb3 \'a0key diff; dependency-lock diff review with special attention to platform wheels (the Darwin-arm64\'a0
\f6\fs28 \cb5 decord
\f0\fs32 \cb3 \'a0gap).\cb1 \
\ls6\ilvl0
\f1 \cb3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	2	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Behavioral:
\f0 \'a0conversion fixtures (checkpoint \uc0\u8594  engine format, hash-stable); representative smokes for\'a0
\f6\fs28 \cb5 wan_2_2_t2i
\f0\fs32 \cb3 , travel segment, and join stitch on fixed seeds and a reference hardware profile; comparison against a golden set \'97 exact hash for deterministic configs, perceptual band (SSIM/LPIPS with fixed seeds) for stochastic ones.\cb1 \
\ls6\ilvl0
\f1 \cb3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	3	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Decision policy:
\f0 \'a0auto-reject on patch failure, import break, required-config-key removal, smoke crash, output beyond tolerance, or VRAM regression past threshold. A pure manifest bump (no behavioral delta) auto-passes with provenance update.\cb1 \
\ls6\ilvl0
\f1 \cb3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	4	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Rollout:
\f0 \'a0drain queue \uc0\u8594  swap SHA \u8594  rebuild \u8594  retain prior build directory and manifest; rollback is flipping a pointer. Provenance records which manifest produced every accepted output, so any historical result is reproducible.\cb1 \
\ls6\ilvl0
\f1 \cb3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	5	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Hermeticity:
\f0 \'a0vendored pinned wheels, locked runtime environment, environment fingerprint in the manifest.\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb3 Drift becomes observable (manifest diff), reversible (retained builds), and rare-to-debug (gates catch it before users do).\
